# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# UE4.27 + AirSim 项目 .gitignore
# 目的：只跟踪源码与配置，构建产物、编辑器缓存和大型资产包不入库
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Unreal 构建产物
Binaries/
Build/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/
Plugins/*/DerivedDataCache/

# Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.user
*.userprefs
.idea/

# 调试符号与临时文件
*.pdb
*.obj
*.exp
*.ilk
*.tmp
*.log
*.cache
.vsconfig

# 系统文件
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# 工程资产（体积过大，约 8.6 GB，未纳入本仓库）
# 需要完整工程时请向维护者索取 Content 目录
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Content/*
!Content/README.md
